WEBVTT

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:28.020
<i>Jean and the others have crash-landed in an African village</i>

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:31.150
<i>where Nadia has fallen in love at first sight with Hamahama</i>

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:33.690
<i>whom she met in the village.</i>

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:36.650
<i>Jean is terribly upset.</i>

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.070
<i>King was captured by villains who covet the village's treasures</i>

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:42.620
<i>while he was running recklessly after drinking some red fruit juice</i>

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:46.620
<i>he found at the altar in the village temple.</i>

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:52.960
<i>The villains are demanding the village's treasure for King.</i>

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:57.430
<i>What will happen to King? How is Nadia's love going to turn out?</i>

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:00.390
<i>Only twenty-four hours are left.</i>

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:04.100
<i>King's rescue is about to begin.</i>

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:13.360
You should spend your time dusting off my treasure till then.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.780
That voice!

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:16.190
What is it?

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.110
That voice! That figure!

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:20.200
Senorita, be careful!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.370
I'd never forget him. Gonzalez!

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:23.490
Gonzalez?

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.580
What are you doing?

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.960
Nice to meet you again.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:33.670
You are Grandis Granba from Italy, aren't you?

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:39.630
How strange to meet you here in the vastness of Africa after so long.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:42.180
Mr. Gonzalez, is she your friend?

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:46.100
She talks to you with shocking familiarity.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.600
Never mind her. She was one of my girls.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.310
She's just happy to meet me again.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:55.940
Go to Hell!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.530
What's wrong?

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:01.820
Oh, I was just remembering something.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:03.620
About that man?

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:09.500
I'm the most unfortunate woman in the world to have met him here.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:16.460
Behaving like a villain! With two women! Way out here in Africa!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:19.420
Your love has turned just as passionately to hatred.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.840
Love? You mean Gonzalez?

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:26.100
I've learned how a woman in love feels.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:32.400
A woman's heart is just like this hot water.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.320
Sometimes it is cold, and sometimes it is burning hot.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:42.070
It flows from a high to a low place according to the laws of nature.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:46.330
I will flow to that boy waiting for me!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:53.460
Hey, will you be careful? I was almost scalded!

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.170
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.380
How is that?

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.300
Don't look at me, you pervert!

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.470
I feel sorry for Jean.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.980
Now that the Gratan is all right,

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.850
shall we go rescue King?

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:18.980
How can Grandis and Nadia take a leisurely bath

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.820
when King's fate hangs in the balance?

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:25.030
I can't believe those two!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:31.830
But Grandis seems pretty troubled since our enemy is her first love.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.370
This is very unfortunate.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:39.090
But now the problem is, what if she falls in love with him again?

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:40.550
Falls in love again?

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:43.010
Her current hatred stems from her past great love.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.470
I hope she doesn't have a relapse of that disease.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.850
I'll have a talk with him.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:53.350
We've known each other for ten years,

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:57.270
whatever pasts we might have shared.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:00.940
Since I've become so beautiful, he will naturally be fascinated by me,

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.570
allowing us to speak for, say, seventeen minutes.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.700
But he is very good at deceiving people.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.370
I will deceive him too!

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.580
I'll never let those two harlots get the best of me!

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:15.830
Right! Then Hamahama will get King back while you're talking to Gonzalez!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.710
We don't have to do anything?

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.500
Hamahama will rescue King.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.710
Did Nadia say that?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:27.640
Don't get discouraged yet, Jean.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:31.390
Nadia wants to deny our scientific civilization.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.850
We can't just keep our mouth shut about this.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:37.400
That's right! We shouldn't give up this way!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:43.400
Let's get King back before Nadia asks Hamahama!

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:48.320
Then we'll show her the real power of modern science.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:52.200
She's sure to think better of you then, Jean.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.870
Yes, Jean will never be second to Hamahama!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.130
Okay! Wait and see, Nadia!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:10.640
What's happening?

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.100
Our treasure was damaged.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.430
It's just a can of food.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:19.060
No, it's not just a can of food, but a very important can of food.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.400
That...

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.150
Must be King's work.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:27.070
Hamahama, Gonzalez must have done it!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:31.200
How awful they are to have eaten the treasure of this village!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.160
King will be in a fix soon! Let's go and rescue him!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.790
Grandis is gone?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.580
Let's go rescue King quickly.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.000
She isn't in the tent either.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.000
Impossible!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.170
Is she with Gonzalez?

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.130
They've fallen in love again?

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:01.150
Why don't you have a seat while we talk?

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.770
I have nothing to say to you,

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.070
just give me King back!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.950
King? That lion cub?

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:14.410
Don't worry. They will bring the treasure.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:19.000
The lion is their guardian animal. They won't let him die.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.080
And I'm not such an evil man either.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.800
Bravo, Mr. Gonzalez! Your plan is fantastic!

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:29.380
That's right! The treasure will soon be ours!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:35.300
Hamahama, how are just the two of us going to help King?

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.310
Nadia, don't worry.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:40.980
We are the tribe that has never been defeated!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.100
They are no match for us!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:48.440
What is this treasure you want so much?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.780
What? Did you come to that village without knowing about it?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.450
Is it so wonderful a treasure?

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:00.330
We'll...

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:01.830
...withdraw.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:06.750
Well? Shall we drink to your eyes?

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.220
Good, I can play for time now.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:18.140
Nadia will help King out in the meantime.

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.680
We'll be through the woods soon.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:25.810
We could have made a better plan if we had the balloon.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.150
How are we going to rescue King?

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.860
This is no time to play stupid tricks!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:31.650
So?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.450
Just charge!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.960
Has Grandis arrived yet?

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:45.040
I'll go by myself from here on.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.710
You should wait here, Nadia.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.170
Hamahama, I'll act as a decoy.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.340
Decoy?

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:55.470
Help King out while I draw Gonzalez's attention.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:56.930
Nadia!

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:59.260
Rescue King!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.390
Okay!

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:06.650
You mean to say that there's a pillar of silver in that village?

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:10.230
I'll be the richest man in Europe,

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:13.280
no, in the world if I can capture that pillar.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.610
A pillar of silver, the richest in the world!

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:20.830
Grandis, we were so young ten years ago.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.790
All I've ever wished for was to have money.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.750
I was able to do anything

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.670
with the money I've acquired.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.630
I lived in plenty,

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:34.840
but that was all.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:38.760
Something has been missing in my life these ten years.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:41.010
Do you know what that is?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.470
It was you!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.600
Mr. Gonzalez!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.440
Let's forget about our disgusting past.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:52.900
Let's live happily-ever-after!

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.570
Grandis, what are you doing?

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.370
I was just acting as a decoy.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:04.330
How cruel! How disgusting! You have betrayed us!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.580
And just who are you?

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:08.040
That's none of your business!

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.920
There it is!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.680
What happened?

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.510
I can't see anymore.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.180
King! King!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:27.770
I'm here to rescue you.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.230
Be quiet! He'll hear us.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.280
What's that?

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.450
This is Gratan's balloon!

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.200
Marie mended it.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:47.710
Yes, yes.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:49.250
Why is it here?

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.330
What are you going to do?

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.790
Everything will be over if we charge without being able to see.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:57.420
Enough already! Let's stop!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.260
This rescue operation is over!

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:09.100
A guy like him was your first love?

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:13.480
From fraud and stealing to kidnapping,

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.690
you'll commit any kind of crime now, won't you?

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:18.940
Oh, no, I just collect the treasures

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:24.530
from the African continent so that the people of the world

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:26.490
can learn more about Africa.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.370
There are some remarkable treasures in Africa.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:34.750
Africans willingly turn them over after some peaceful negotiations.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.380
That is the modern way.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.260
You're always so dandy, Mr. Gonzalez!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.050
You're so wonderful.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:45.140
Gonzalez is a gifted conniver,

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:47.930
but his followers are just two women with blonde hair.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:51.770
This means we have an advantage over them!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:58.900
But now King, Nadia and Grandis are held captive in his armored car!

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.990
What if... Are you listening?

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:04.280
What if Gonzalez learned that the treasure of this village

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:09.790
is just a can of food that's already been eaten by King?

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.920
This is just an example.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:23.880
Not just King, but Nadia and Grandis as well...

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.470
Especially Grandis...

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:29.600
She's being held by her first love who betrayed her ten years ago.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.560
She could be deceived again

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:35.270
and fall victim to that nasty middle-aged man.

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.020
I can't stand waiting here any longer!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.320
He'll pay! Damn!

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.820
Ayerton, take it easy!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.950
We understand how you feel!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:50.450
Understand? You'll never understand! Nobody will!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:56.380
I'm going to rescue Grandis!

00:12:56.380 --> 00:13:01.010
The villagers soon will bring the treasure in order to save you,

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:02.340
to save three small lives.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.800
Nobody will bring the treasure!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:06.260
What did you say?

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.720
Because there's no more treasure!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.520
Stop trying to kid me.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:16.060
It's true! The treasure was just a can of food!

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.060
It's completely worthless!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:23.490
You should learn how to tell better lies than that, Miss.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:28.450
We have the mighty Gratan and its balloon

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.830
which we came across by accident out in the woods.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:35.870
It is under repair now.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.710
Good! Very good!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:41.800
We can attack them from both the land and the sky!

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:45.760
Why do I always have to be the one to mend this?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.510
Hey, how's it coming along?

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:48.970
It will be ready soon!

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:53.060
Gonzalez's armored car is located at the top of the hill.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:56.190
It has the best view of the surroundings.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:14:01.650
There's no approach from which the Gratan or the balloon can attack.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:07.860
So, you're just giving up? We can't do anything with this equipment?

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.780
We can't afford to be defeated!

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:13.700
We cannot undertake any operation

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:16.330
without the conviction of victory!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.380
So late! What does he think he's doing?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:25.840
Oh, dear, don't get so angry, my dear Gonzalez!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:29.840
Poor lion. He has just a short time more to live.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.890
You can't beat them!

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:36.810
Hamahama has never been defeated before!

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:42.730
Girls should be quiet and concern themselves with womanly matters.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:47.030
You're right, Mr. Gonzalez. Girls should be graceful.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.320
Girls should be sweet.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.990
We have a chance of winning.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:56.040
There's a river going past the armored car.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:00.500
We can charge the car if we go through the river.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.960
The river?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:05.050
But it's too narrow for the Gratan to get through.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:11.140
Don't worry. We have already installed Gratan's screw on Hamahama's canoe.

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:13.600
We can start anytime.

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.390
Oh, that's great!

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:20.390
Modern science and traditional culture joining together.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:24.310
We will execute our operations in concert with each other!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.570
Well? What shall I do then?

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:31.240
The Gratan must attract Gonzalez's attention.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.780
We want you to launch a frontal attack on Gonzalez's armored car.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.540
We'll take advantage of this distraction.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.250
A decoy?

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.250
But Hanson, what will happen to the Gratan?

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:49.050
I know, but we must use everything to save the women and the lion.

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.220
We must give up the Gratan.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:55.100
Okay, if you say so!

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:59.180
I'll be the decoy to attract their attention!

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:04.610
We'll make King drink the red fruit juice made in the village.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:07.570
Yes, anybody would be full of energy after drinking that.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:11.530
With 100 times his normal strength, King can escape from the cross.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:15.530
I'll send this robot King to replace the real King.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.240
Good! That's a good idea!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:22.790
How do we make King drink the juice without Gonzalez knowing about it?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.540
Just put it into King's mouth?

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.210
That's right.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.670
I'm a skilled marksman!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:31.840
Why do I have to be a decoy?

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:36.850
Because you have such a wonderful skill for driving.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:41.390
That's not fair, Sanson! Ayerton will break the Gratan again!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:44.730
But you said you would fix up the Gratan after this.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.270
No, I don't want him to break it!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.280
Let's go now!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.900
Okay! I'll be in it too.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.860
Then, Marie and I will be in the balloon.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.240
How about me?

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:59.580
You go in Hamahama's canoe to make the robot King attack.

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:00.790
That's right.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:04.120
Everything's set! We now have only one purpose!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:09.710
To rescue King, Nadia and Grandis from Gonzalez's armored car!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:13.340
Some violence is permitted this time!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:15.090
I want you to give it everything you've got!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:18.510
We have a saying we cheer together in our village before a battle.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:19.510
What's that?

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.100
Onta-barai!

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:51.040
Well, well, this is an unusual stone.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:55.420
Don't touch it! It's not the kind of stone you imagine it is!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:59.640
It's the Blue Water even I couldn't touch!

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:03.100
You are certainly right to have an eye on this.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:08.440
I have never seen a stone go on and off, across the whole of Africa.

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:09.730
Thank you so much.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:10.650
You can't take it!

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:15.990
Can't you go more quickly?

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:21.530
As a nobleman, I cannot drive as recklessly as Sanson.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:22.620
I'll make you do it!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.170
Right! Here they come!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.250
The canoe hasn't arrived yet.

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.800
Darn! What's the matter with Jean?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:40.260
I'll rescue Nadia with this robot King!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:44.010
No, I promised Nadia that I would rescue her!

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:48.350
No, Hamahama, I'll rescue Nadia, so you help Grandis!

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.480
I never lie. I'll rescue Nadia.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:58.150
Say, Mr. Gonzalez, will you give me that beautiful stone as a present?

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:02.120
No, give it to me, please!

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:07.290
It's hard to give it to both of you.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:10.250
No! It's not just a stone!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:14.040
Are you going to give the Blue Water to those rotten women?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.760
Yes, these girls have always served me well.

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:21.640
In addition, they are much younger than you.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:25.600
What are you talking about? I'm still in my twenties!

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:30.060
But Ma'am, I'm only twenty years old.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.100
Me too. Look at me.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:35.150
And I have clear skin.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:40.280
I can't stand it anymore! I've had enough of this!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:51.870
This is the moment!

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.390
King has fainted!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:07.970
King!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.060
No, stop, Marie!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:14.270
Damn! Don't you dare make a fool out of me!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.860
Help!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.780
I got it!

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:24.820
Hey, Miss, give me that stone!

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:30.200
Nadia, never mind me! He doesn't have the guts to shoot.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:32.160
Are you sure?

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:38.040
I'll rescue Nadia with my invention!

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.460
I'll rescue Nadia with my boomerang!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:50.770
It's Hamahama!

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.230
Let's get away now!

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:53.100
Right!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:55.650
King! King!

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:57.480
King!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.400
Nadia!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:03.610
King!

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:09.870
Nice catch!

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.160
The Gratan! The Gratan!

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.620
What is it?

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:16.710
How do I stop this thing?

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.670
The brake! Use the brake!

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.600
Nadia!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:33.980
Nadia!

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.270
Hamahama!

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.150
Nadia!

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:53.330
Jambo.

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:58.040
This is a victory for science.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:01.250
I don't think you have any reason to be so glib.

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:08.970
Damn that Grandis!

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:12.220
But the lion is here, Mr. Gonzalez.

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:16.230
We can make a deal with him again.

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:19.690
But something is funny about his color.

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:21.900
And it makes a funny noise too.

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:35.000
I added some tricks to the robot King.

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:37.870
How cruel! How could you have done that?

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:41.080
I'm sorry, Nadia. I couldn't keep our promise.

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:45.550
Never mind, Hamahama! You tried to help me. That's enough.

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:49.550
Let me introduce you. This is Muramura from the next village.

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:50.180
Jambo.

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:53.470
Muramura is going to be my wife!

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:54.430
Your wife?

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:55.890
She is?

00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:58.390
Yes, we were betrothed as children.

00:22:58.390 --> 00:22:59.600
Your fiancee?

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:05.030
Muramura knows where Tartessos is.

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:16.700
It took us some time, but everything worked out after all.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:18.910
We found Nadia's birthplace too.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:19.870
Yep, yep, yep!

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:24.340
Even sad things will turn into happy memories someday.

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:25.300
Yep, yep, yep!

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:29.510
Nadia is lucky to have some boy worrying about her.

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:30.470
Yep, yep, yep!

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:33.470
There are some men for Grandis too!

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:34.930
Yep, yep, yep, yep!

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:37.890
Cheer up, both of you!

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:40.350
Yeah, Nadia, I'm with you!

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:41.520
Hey, Jean.

00:23:41.810 --> 00:23:42.480
What?

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:44.980
I really hate you, Jean!

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:47.980
Jeez, what a stubborn girl!
